  "description": "Our FF29 is now even faster – we are now offering our latest Kinesis FF29 aluminium hardtail mtb frame as a rolling chassis kit. This kit includes any FF29 frameset of your choice, a set of X-Fusion McQueen HLR 140mm forks, a Kinesis headset, and a pair of Stans Arch S2 29\" wheels. We are offering this new FF29 Kit at a 50% discount off the total price. Here's what's included in the new kit:\nFF29 FRAMESET SRP £600The FF29, initially launched in 2012, garnered multiple magazine reviews and awards. For 2024, it's been re-designed and re-introduced – longer, lower, and faster. Our modern hardtail bike comes with updated geometry, new aluminium tubing technology, functional external cable routing and is packed with trail-focussed features. The frame is sized by reach and is designed to be used with a dropper post. Complete with a 65.5º head angle and steep seat-tube, the all-new FF29 remains nimble and agile for singletrack riding, ideal for all-day hard-charging descents and goat-like climbing. With its long, low, and stable design and generous reach numbers, the FF29 lives up to its reputation as Furiously Fast.\nX-FUSION MCQUEEN HLR 140mm FORKS SRP £650The FF29 kit comes with the new X-Fusion McQueen 34 29\"/27.5+ HLR Boost fork, prioritising stiffness without adding excess weight. Weighing just over 2100 grams, the McQueen offers an exceptional stiffness-to-weight ratio. The Roughcut Damper provides high and low-speed compression and rebound damping adjustment, making these forks plush and responsive on the trails.\nSTANS ARCH S2 29\" WHEELS (Micro Spline rear wheel) SRP £675The Stans Arch S2 wheelsets are designed to handle a variety of riding conditions and are an ideal upgrade for Trail, AM, Enduro, and even eBikes. Featuring Stans Patented Bead Socket Technology, these wheels offer easier tubeless inflation and enhanced confidence on the trail. The 6061 aluminium Arch rims, with a reinforced, spoke bed, eyeletted spoke holes, and a reliable sleeved joint, ensure durability and toughness. With a 28mm width, these wheels offer excellent cornering performance with 2.2-2.5\" tyres.\nKINESIS HEADSET SRP £55Integrated Tapered Headsets for Kinesis frames.\nDELIVERY INFORMATION",
